Preserve the discovered artist spelling instead of the Artist DB master name.}\cell\row\pard \trowd\trql\trleft-98\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf15\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf15\clpadft3\clpadt108\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf15\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf15\clpadfr3\clpadr108\cellx5085\clbrdrt\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf15\clbrdrl\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf15\clpadft3\clpadt108\clbrdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf15\clbrdrr\brdrs\brdrw10\brdrcf15\clpadfr3\clpadr108\cellx10267\pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\intbl\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa200{\loch
