17. GitHub update checks and Auto update}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\sl276\slmult1\fi-259\li360\lin360\sb0\sa40{\loch
- Check for updates compares the installed build with the latest public GitHub release and downloads the best matching ZIP to Downloads. TLO does not install or extract the update automatically.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\sl276\slmult1\fi-259\li360\lin360\sb0\sa40{\loch
- Auto update is a download-only startup check. Its setting is stored in TLOHome/update-settings.json, and automatic checks are limited to at most once per day.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\sl276\slmult1\fi-259\li360\lin360\sb0\sa40{\loch
- Current releases contain eight assets: complete and update ZIPs for Windows onefile, Windows onedir, Linux, and macOS.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\sl276\slmult1\fi-259\li360\lin360\sb0\sa40{\loch
- Complete packages include the platform applications, required TLO_DBs files, manual, FAQ, starter files, work folders, manifests, checksums, and scan receipt. Update packages intentionally omit databases and all user-data/output areas.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\sl276\slmult1\fi-259\li360\lin360\sb0\sa40{\loch
- Do not overlay a Windows onefile apps/Windows folder with a Windows onedir folder or vice versa. Replace apps/Windows as a unit when switching layouts; onedir executables require the shared _internal folder.}
\par \pard\plain \s0\rtlch\af12\afs22\alang1025 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1033\hich\af2\loch\sl276\slmult1\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb0\sa200\ltrpar\cf0\f2\fs20\lang1033\kerning0\dbch\af10\langfe1033\sl276\slmult1\fi-259\li360\lin360\sb0\sa40{\loch
- Close all TLO applications before applying an update.}
